    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:540b977a6b90169b9e602f03",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "以无酒精金酒为基底，加入杏子糖浆、\n橙汁一起摇晃。\n这就是，丁托列托描绘的天国……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9ef2aefe2737e4c9ccb53ae32fdf1ed53a6b8f063e0b60fcb9ec2b0eb5861288",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0009/storytimeline_400009317.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        29,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/29/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e7f798b07a900020227ea073",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "被踢倒的栅栏没有散架，\n上半部分还是完整的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a9afcb41216f856c25cc24af320391d97308b28cd870ff12fb08117a30d3958",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0009/storytimeline_400009317.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:16d797458032b04276d5e68c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……不会太甜，好好喝！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e6a2f25de241efd6a6f17533cc72345f3515082ac583b89095201f56aef1d98",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0009/storytimeline_400009317.json",
      "json_path": [
