    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a7b34849b400507c7cc98642",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "今夜的太阳过于躁动，我多加了些金酒。\n调制成了辛辣的口味。怎么样？",
      "source_fingerprint": "077f04f0bfd0c169d58e00d43b8b4bdb912d1b31735c9d1960eab6f15ed2097e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0009/storytimeline_400009317.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        30,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/30/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b9422052164c6d6b5528ea19",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "适中的酸甜――喝下去后口中留下的，\n是清爽的风味。这杯酒带来夏天开始的预兆！\n当我赞叹的时候……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "320dedc5e829809eacafca2ea4c5f59a9a815cb8c3830da12c16c0da1640e544",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0009/storytimeline_400009317.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        31,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/31/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:309c1bbf6be023a16fd9d9bf",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……诶！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5cd235981d03cf23c24993d080af4d74c8009cb50f304f955dd730ba3fc3d27c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/40/0009/storytimeline_400009317.json",
