      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我完成了梦想――停滞不前。既然如此……\n啊！　去寻找新的渴望！　你我展望的，\n安田宝冢路线，去抓住――那个未来！",
      "source_fingerprint": "14a2f4dbc41a9367b3e1fbaad821cdb5f35870953dc35bca3f638bef28c3888a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
